# Reopening after a lost port (Phase 3): the notes that were sounding
# when it was lost get their note-offs at once, then All Notes Off
# (CC 123) on all 16 channels, so nothing is left hanging on the synth.
# Tracks 1 and 2 both sound 60 on channel 1 (one note-off, by the
# count); track 3 has 66 sounding. The port is lost at beat 4 by the
# note-off of 60 itself (track 2's, the one that reaches 0), which the
# synth never got, so it is sent on reopen too.
open virtual
track 1 60:4
  takes over at beat 0.000 (t0)
track 2:1 60:4
  takes over at beat 0.000 (t0)
track 3 64:1 65:1 66:2
  takes over at beat 0.000 (t0)
play continue
  was playing: 0
runto 3
log
  0.000 t0 0.000ms ON  ch1 60 v100
  0.000 t0 0.000ms ON  ch1 60 v100
  0.000 t0 0.000ms ON  ch3 64 v100
  1.000 t2520 500.000ms OFF ch3 64
  1.000 t2520 500.000ms ON  ch3 65 v100
  2.000 t5040 1000.000ms OFF ch3 65
  2.000 t5040 1000.000ms ON  ch3 66 v100
failwrites on
runto 5
  error: SEQ_ERR_IO (MIDI port lost)
state
  seq: PORT_LOST beat 4.000 (t10080) tempo 120 tracks 3
  track 1: notes 1 ch 1 mute 0 loop 1 vel 100 length 4.000 (t10080) pending 0 position 0.000 (t0)
  track 2: notes 1 ch 1 mute 0 loop 1 vel 100 length 4.000 (t10080) pending 0 position 0.000 (t0)
  track 3: notes 3 ch 3 mute 0 loop 1 vel 100 length 4.000 (t10080) pending 0 position 0.000 (t0)
log
failwrites off
open virtual
log
  4.000 t10080 2000.000ms OFF ch1 60
  4.000 t10080 2000.000ms OFF ch3 66
  4.000 t10080 2000.000ms CC  ch1 123 0
  4.000 t10080 2000.000ms CC  ch2 123 0
  4.000 t10080 2000.000ms CC  ch3 123 0
  4.000 t10080 2000.000ms CC  ch4 123 0
  4.000 t10080 2000.000ms CC  ch5 123 0
  4.000 t10080 2000.000ms CC  ch6 123 0
  4.000 t10080 2000.000ms CC  ch7 123 0
  4.000 t10080 2000.000ms CC  ch8 123 0
  4.000 t10080 2000.000ms CC  ch9 123 0
  4.000 t10080 2000.000ms CC  ch10 123 0
  4.000 t10080 2000.000ms CC  ch11 123 0
  4.000 t10080 2000.000ms CC  ch12 123 0
  4.000 t10080 2000.000ms CC  ch13 123 0
  4.000 t10080 2000.000ms CC  ch14 123 0
  4.000 t10080 2000.000ms CC  ch15 123 0
  4.000 t10080 2000.000ms CC  ch16 123 0
play continue
  was playing: 0
runto 5
log
  4.000 t10080 2000.000ms ON  ch1 60 v100
  4.000 t10080 2000.000ms ON  ch1 60 v100
  4.000 t10080 2000.000ms ON  ch3 64 v100
# lost again at beat 6, by track 3's note-off of 65 (60 on channel 1
# is sounding): the same again
runto 5.5
log
  5.000 t12600 2500.000ms OFF ch3 64
  5.000 t12600 2500.000ms ON  ch3 65 v100
failwrites on
runto 7
  error: SEQ_ERR_IO (MIDI port lost)
failwrites off
open virtual
log
  6.000 t15120 3000.000ms OFF ch1 60
  6.000 t15120 3000.000ms OFF ch3 65
  6.000 t15120 3000.000ms CC  ch1 123 0
  6.000 t15120 3000.000ms CC  ch2 123 0
  6.000 t15120 3000.000ms CC  ch3 123 0
  6.000 t15120 3000.000ms CC  ch4 123 0
  6.000 t15120 3000.000ms CC  ch5 123 0
  6.000 t15120 3000.000ms CC  ch6 123 0
  6.000 t15120 3000.000ms CC  ch7 123 0
  6.000 t15120 3000.000ms CC  ch8 123 0
  6.000 t15120 3000.000ms CC  ch9 123 0
  6.000 t15120 3000.000ms CC  ch10 123 0
  6.000 t15120 3000.000ms CC  ch11 123 0
  6.000 t15120 3000.000ms CC  ch12 123 0
  6.000 t15120 3000.000ms CC  ch13 123 0
  6.000 t15120 3000.000ms CC  ch14 123 0
  6.000 t15120 3000.000ms CC  ch15 123 0
  6.000 t15120 3000.000ms CC  ch16 123 0
close
  closed: 1 2 3
